msgid "Be careful, Grantlee does not support '-' in variable name. So when you want to add extra header as \"X-Original-To\" add \"X-Original-To\" in list, but use \"XOriginalTo\" as variable in Grantlee (remove '-' in name)."
msgstr "Wohrschau, Grantlee ünnerstütt kenn Binnstreek (\"-\") binnen Variabelnaams. Wullt Du Koppreeg bito as \"X-Original-To\" tofögen, föög op de List \"X-Original-To\" to, man bruuk \"XOriginialTo\" (ahn \"-\" dor binnen) as Variabel binnen Grantlee."

